<</CreationDate(D:20101109172102Z)/Subject(Dyeing auxiliary composition for leather comprises a polyoxyalkylene derivative of a condensation product of \(a\) one or more of polyalkylene \(with 1 to 30 C\) polyamines \(n=1 to 20\), alkyl or alkenyl amines with 1 to 30 C, aromatic amines, and primar\
y or secondary alkanolamines; \(b\) an aromatic compound having hydroxyl \(OH\) group, alkyl group with 1 to 10 C or alkenyl group with 1 to 10 C, and \(c\) formaldehyde or paraformaldehyde. With this composition, any anionic dyes may be used for surface \
